# ── FLOW: TRADE CREATION ────────────────────────────────────────────

@When "^creates a new '([^']*)' trade$"
    When page trade portal clicks new trade button
    And page new trade container is visible
    And page new trade selects basic mandatory info for product '$1'
    And upload '$1' dat file
    And page new trade book and captures trade id as 'createdTradeId'
    And page trade detail header card contains from stored variable 'createdTradeId'

@When "^creates a new '([^']*)' StepIn partial trade$"
    When page trade portal clicks new trade button
    And upload '$1' dat file
    And page new trade selects basic mandatory info for product '$1'
    And page new trade enables stepin toggle
    And page new trade selects stepin partial radio
    And page new trade selects old counterparty from stored variable 'stepIn.oldCounterpartyName'
    And page new trade book and captures trade id as 'createdTradeId'

@When "^creates a new '([^']*)' StepIn full trade$"
    When page trade portal clicks new trade button
    And upload '$1' dat file
    And page new trade selects basic mandatory info for product '$1'
    And page new trade enables stepin toggle
    And page new trade selects stepin full radio
    And page new trade selects old counterparty from stored variable 'stepIn.oldCounterpartyName'
    And page new trade book and captures trade id as 'createdTradeId'

@Then "^trade is created with pending approval status and info$"
    Then page trade detail header card contains from stored variable 'createdTradeId'
    And page trade detail status badge shows 'PARV'
    And the trade show correct info in trade details

@Then "^trade is created with live status and info$"
    Then page trade detail header card contains from stored variable 'createdTradeId'
    And page trade detail status badge shows 'LIVE'
    And the trade show correct info in trade details

@Then "^the StepIn Full trade is Live in trade details$"
    Then the trade remains Live in trade details

@Then "^the newly created trade is pending checker approval$"
    Then the trade has status 'PARV' and event status 'New' in the blotter

@Then "^the StepIn Full trade is pending checker approval$"
    Then the trade has status 'PARV' and event status 'StepInFull' in the blotter

@Then "^the StepIn Partial trade is pending checker approval$"
    Then the trade has status 'PARV' and event status 'StepInPartial' in the blotter

@Then "^the StepIn Partial trade is reverted to Draft$"
    Then the trade has status 'DRFT' and event status 'StepInPartial' in the blotter

@Then "^the rejected trade submission is reverted to Draft$"
    Then trade status is updated to 'DRFT' and event status is updated to 'New' in the trade portal page

@Then "^the StepIn Full trade is Live after checker approval$"
    Then trade status is updated to 'LIVE' and event status is updated to 'StepInFull' in the trade portal page
